sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Device as ESP32 / Simulator (100Hz)
  participant DevChannel as /ws/device (Authenticated)
  participant WSServer as Gateway Memory Router
  participant LiveChannel as /ws/live (Public Subscribers)
  actor Frontend as React App (LiveSession Page)

  Frontend->>LiveChannel: WS Handshake (Connect to /ws/live)
  LiveChannel-->>Frontend: 101 Switching Protocols (Connected)

  Device->>DevChannel: WS Handshake (/ws/device?token=SECRET)
  DevChannel-->>Device: 101 Switching Protocols (Authorized)

  Note over Device,Frontend: Physical Turn Begins (1.5 seconds / 150 Frames)

  loop Every 10ms (100 Hz Stream)
    Device->>DevChannel: {"type": "frame", "data": {t, force, gyro, accel}}
    DevChannel->>WSServer: In-memory packet ingestion
    Note over WSServer: NO Disk I/O: Frames bypass database in normal mode!
    WSServer->>LiveChannel: Broadcast {"type": "live_frame", "data": {...}}
    LiveChannel-->>Frontend: Dispatch to ws.ts handler
    Frontend->>Frontend: appendLiveFrame() in Zustand store
    Frontend->>Frontend: Re-render SVG 3-Channel Oscilloscope (60fps)
  end

  Note over Device,Frontend: Turn Finishes: Edge Decision Executed

  Device->>DevChannel: {"type": "status", "data": {state, boltExtended, solenoidEngaged}}
  DevChannel->>WSServer: Route state change
  WSServer->>LiveChannel: Broadcast {"type": "status", "data": {...}}
  LiveChannel-->>Frontend: Update Solenoid Bolt & Orb Colors
